WEBVTT

00:00.250 --> 00:02.071
Here's how to get Trade Levels Pro's levels

00:02.071 --> 00:04.363
drawn right on your TradingView chart.

00:04.283 --> 00:05.364
It takes about a minute,

00:05.364 --> 00:07.681
plus one quick step every day.

00:07.881 --> 00:10.763
Open Today's Plan on tradelevelspro.com.

00:10.683 --> 00:12.782
You'll need to be logged in as a member.

00:12.932 --> 00:16.069
Scroll down and click Show TradingView indicator code.

00:17.032 --> 00:18.148
Hit Copy code.

00:18.068 --> 00:19.337
It flips to Copied.

00:19.537 --> 00:22.122
Now open TradingView and pull up ES,

00:22.122 --> 00:24.404
the E-mini S&P futures.

00:24.604 --> 00:25.896
Open the Pine Editor.

00:27.354 --> 00:28.478
Select everything,

00:28.478 --> 00:29.813
and paste in the code.

00:30.254 --> 00:31.398
Click Add to chart.

00:33.804 --> 00:34.755
And there it is.

00:35.454 --> 00:37.287
Today's long levels and targets,

00:37.287 --> 00:39.905
plus the line where the long idea is wrong,

00:39.905 --> 00:41.696
with the bias in the corner.

00:42.054 --> 00:43.529
Now the step people miss.

00:43.449 --> 00:45.456
Every trading day, a new plan posts

00:45.456 --> 00:48.740
by 5:30 PM Eastern, with new levels.

00:48.660 --> 00:51.057
TradingView can't pull them in on its own.

00:50.977 --> 00:51.525
So copy the fresh code from Today's Plan,

00:52.854 --> 00:55.354
paste it over the old code in the Pine Editor,

00:55.754 --> 00:57.276
and click Update on chart.

00:58.154 --> 00:59.834
Then check the box in the corner.

00:59.834 --> 01:01.288
It shows the plan date.

01:02.304 --> 01:03.590
Full plan available.

01:03.510 --> 01:04.492
Grab a free sample at

01:04.492 --> 01:07.526
tradelevelspro.com/sample.

01:07.446 --> 01:10.264
Educational only. Not financial advice.
